{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Return To A Familiar Style Of 2D Platformers</strong></h2><strong>Kaz's Adventure aims to faithfully recreate the charm and fun of the old games we used to enjoy but with a present day gameplay twist and additions</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/extras/cut_scene_1-vz9amx9s_6_600x350.png?t=1743161478\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traverse Through 5 Amazing Worlds!</strong></h2><strong>Kaz's Adventure has 5 amazing worlds to explore and defeat with 6 levels in each of the worlds</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/extras/Hnet-image.gif?t=1743161478\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Jars Of Power!</strong></h2><strong>In each level you can find a jar to collect, Reaching certain milestones will unlock new modes and levels to play and enjoy</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/extras/2022-06-28_14-23-16_Trim_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743161478\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dangerous &amp; Unique Enemies</strong></h2><strong>Throughout your travels you'll encounter different enemy's in different worlds, some may be from a previous world but mutated in a way that makes it act different or new enemies which make your time in that new world unique and exciting</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/extras/2022-06-28_14-24-05_Trim_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743161478\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Your Own Levels</strong></h2><strong>Create Your Own Levels In The Level Editor Which Can Be Unlocked By Reaching A Certain Milestone In Collectibles</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/extras/unknown_600x350.png?t=1743161478\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completed: World 1 Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/048d0d3519077614c123d8c36e8493bf763227b2.jpg"},{"name":"Completed: World 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/480f7e3a12173f3775449d6768e17b0a1147ddb5.jpg"},{"name":"Completed: World 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/4b8d52d53b880c63767872d97f12ef1b3e9417af.jpg"},{"name":"Experience Nightmare's Horror ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/7c81e6adcc5e11468c3ea3235b6a583f8369f466.jpg"},{"name":"Completed: World 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/73b5cd6e5e70610135975b2d78f3dba4ddec8dcb.jpg"},{"name":"Avenged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/a7c0c32b92ca259220d8f679b0495b2ebfc19c2d.jpg"},{"name":"Collected: 10 Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/6251552c04253414ace0e01810bac5f5b78eee73.jpg"},{"name":"Collected: 30 Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/2cbbb4b9505729c7436b4b84b9bdef6cb0990035.jpg"},{"name":"Collected: 50 Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/6c1adc90f9a9494c1ab89288719f27ba6fc1c519.jpg"},{"name":"Collected: 75 Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2013680/314a57b08fffbfdaccab113209391e031f4ca44e.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2013680?t=1743161478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743161478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013680/